{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "NUM",
 "chapter": 11,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.4",
   "range": "NUM.11.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1aff7e79",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.4#p1-1aff7e79",
     "text": "Which were of those strangers that came out of Egypt with them, Ex 12:38.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "multitude that was among them fell",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 12:38",
       "ref": "EXO.12.38"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.5",
   "range": "NUM.11.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "081cb727",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.5#p1-081cb727",
     "text": "For a final price, or good cheap.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "freely"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.6",
   "range": "NUM.11.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4ccfe291",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.6#p1-4ccfe291",
     "text": "For the greedy lust of flesh.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "dried away"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.7",
   "range": "NUM.11.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "69711ac3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.7#p1-69711ac3",
     "text": "Which is a white pearl, or precious stone.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "bdellium"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.11",
   "range": "NUM.11.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "aae1c890",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.11#p1-aae1c890",
     "text": "Or, how have I displeased you?",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "favour in thy sight"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.12",
   "range": "NUM.11.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a99a8715",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.12#p1-9c88665a",
     "text": "Am I their father, that no one may have charge of them but I?",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "conceived all this people"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.12#p2-ce3395a2",
     "text": "Of Canaan promised by another to our fathers.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "land which thou swarest unto their"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.15",
   "range": "NUM.11.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8f1de0f4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.15#p1-8f1de0f4",
     "text": "I would rather die than see my grief and misery daily increased by their rebellion.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "sight"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.17",
   "range": "NUM.11.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "007e2aaf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.17#p1-007e2aaf",
     "text": "I will distribute my spirit among them, as I have done to you.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "and I will take of the"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.18",
   "range": "NUM.11.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "77ec6f19",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.18#p1-77ec6f19",
     "text": "Prepare yourselves that you may be clean.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "Sanctify yourselves against to morrow"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.20",
   "range": "NUM.11.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d9992bbb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.20#p1-fe953ae7",
     "text": "Or, cast him off, because you refused manna, which he appointed as most suitable for you.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "despised the LORD which is"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.20#p2-b5483331",
     "text": "Who leads and governs you.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "among you"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.21",
   "range": "NUM.11.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "092c513a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.21#p1-092c513a",
     "text": "Of whom I have charge.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "among whom I am"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.25",
   "range": "NUM.11.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "37f02ab4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.25#p1-37f02ab4",
     "text": "From that day the spirit of prophecy did not settle them.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "cease"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.28",
   "range": "NUM.11.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f4811c4b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.28#p1-6efc1faa",
     "text": "Or, a young man whom he had chosen from his youth.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "young men"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.28#p2-e14727ec",
     "text": "Such blind zeal was in the apostles, Mr 9:38, Lu 9:44.",
     "label": "r",
     "anchor": "forbid them",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Mr 9:38, Lu 9:44",
       "ref": "MRK.9.38"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mr 9:38, Lu 9:44",
       "ref": "LUK.9.44"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.11.32",
   "range": "NUM.11.32",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f8a7a591",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.11.32#p1-f8a7a591",
     "text": "Of Homer, read Le 27:16 also it signifies a heap, as in Ex 8:14; Jud 15:16.",
     "label": "s",
     "anchor": "homers",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Le 27:16",
       "ref": "LEV.27.16"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ex 8:14; Jud 15:16",
       "ref": "EXO.8.14"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ex 8:14; Jud 15:16",
       "ref": "JDG.15.16"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
